## Failure recovery

Create, Update, and Delete retry HTTP 429 responses with the same request within
the operation timeout. Connection errors and HTTP 5xx responses are not
automatically retried.

After a failed create, check the App Definition for an action created without
saved Terraform state and import it before applying again. After a failed update
or delete, refresh state and review the plan before retrying.

Read and import preserve existing Custom parameter definitions. Updates validate
the complete planned `parameters`, including values retained by `ignore_changes`.

